# Sound for new messages (docs/apps/inbox.md "Sound"): `phone.sound` is on in this test's config.json. The launcher reads the
# relay (fixtures of inbox.script: chats and mails nobody saw): one chime for all of them.
wait 2500
expect-chimes 1
shot inbox-sound-launcher
tap 270 424             # Settings
wait 900
tap 270 268             # Display and sound
wait 900
shot inbox-sound-settings
tap 470 545             # the switch off: silent
wait 900
expect-chimes 1
shot inbox-sound-settings-off
tap 470 545             # on again: it plays once, so the user hears what it is
wait 900
expect-chimes 2
